+//    the officer is called in anyway (stress). The home crew comes back on the next shift.
+//  · Chief — staff training: an officer from the reserve goes on a course for one or two shifts and comes
+//    back with a second specialty (a crew with the right specialty works 15% faster, calls.js) or with
+//    higher skill.
+//  · Career — transfer between departments is a request: three shifts of waiting, then the personnel
+//    office decides (after an unsatisfactory attestation the transfer is refused). New department:
+//    road police (Дорожная полиция).
+//  · Career — what the savings are for: a gym pass, a holiday trip, an own car, a down payment for a flat.
+//  · Chief — a workshop at the station: repairs cheaper and faster.
